  "alt": "A query for error code E-4048 goes to vector search, which returns both E-4048 and the near-identical E-4049 as close matches. A cross-encoder then reads the query and each document together: it rejects the document about E-4049 and keeps the document about E-4048.",
  "caption": "To a bi-encoder, E-4049 looks as close as E-4048. The cross-encoder reads the exact string and keeps only the match.",
